DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:Deadline: Klang Copenhagen Avantgarde Music Festival: Open Call 202
 7\, MUSIC/MOVEMENT
DESCRIPTION:Klang\, Copenhagen's avantgarde music festival\, is seeking one
  to three projects at the intersection of experimental music and movement\
 , dance or choreography for its 2027 edition at Dansehallerne. Important c
 onstraint: the call is explicitly for ready-to-go projects\, not commissio
 ns or works in progress\, so the work must already be finished and product
 ion-ready. Submission is a one-page PDF covering artistic description\, bu
 dget overview\, bios\, duration and media links\, emailed to opencall@klan
 g.dk with 'Open Call 2027' in the subject line. The submission window runs
  1 July to 1 September 2026. The toaspern|moeller duo together with Klang 
 Festival review feasible submissions in September 2026\, with notification
  in October 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Klang - Copenhagen Avantgarde Music Fes
 tival\nLocation: Dansehallerne\, Copenhagen\, Denmark. No nationality\, ag
 e or education restrictions are stated on the call page.\nAward: Klang aim
 s to cover production costs and performer fees. Travel and accommodation a
 re discussed case by case rather than guaranteed. No commission fee is off
 ered\, since the call seeks finished work rather than new creation. No app
 lication fee.\nDuration: Performance during Klang Festival 2027\, provisio
 nal dates 15 to 18 June 2027\n\nMore: https://www.klang.dk/open-calls/open
 call2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.klang.dk/open-calls/opencall2027?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Dansehallerne\, Copenhagen\, Denmark. No nationality\, age or educ
 ation restrictions are stated on the call page.
END:VEVENT
